# How do I download a compute job input from the shell?
# Fetch a workunit input bundle from compute storage and unpack the tar.gz into a target directory.
#
# GENERATED from doc/recipes/shell/compute/how_do_i_download_a_compute_job_input_from_the_shell.org — do not edit by hand.
